        "CRUN NEXT — NATIVE MEDIA WORKFLOW\n\nSTART: Action=prepare, optional cap=0, Take=0. No upload, provider request or generation occurs in Prepare.\nChoose local media in the connected Load nodes. Native inputs keep their documented roles; URL/JSON fallbacks remain Advanced.\nEstimate uploads references and displays the current quote. Generate submits once, waits and returns native media directly to Preview/Save.\nThe same settings and Take resume/reuse their existing task. Increase Take only to intentionally request a new paid generation.\nAfter a timeout, keep the task ID and resume it; do not create a replacement automatically.\nThe optional positive cap stays under Advanced; 0 disables it. Actual credits and remaining balance are separate from estimates.\nEnter your API key only in Settings > CRUN Next, never in this graph.\n\nOption: Crun Suno Music Generate API\nModel: suno/music-generate\nDocumentation: https://docs.crun.ai/suno-api/generate-music\n"
